    - rid: 4707331692992135348
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: What the hunter does now that it learned you hide in lockers. Second line of the lesson card (shrinks to fit 720 px) and the pause lessons panel (wraps, 500 px). ALL CAPS
    - rid: 4707331692992135349
      type: {class: Comment, ns: UnityEngine.Localization.Metadata, asm: Unity.Localization}
      data:
        m_CommentText: What the hunter does now that it learned you throw bottles to distract it. Same places and limits as ui.hunter.effect.lockers
    - rid: 4707331692992135350
